"%@ is still loaded, and a game cannot be unloaded once it has started. Close Husk with the button above, then open it again to play %@." = "%@ 仍处于加载状态，游戏启动后无法卸载出内存。请点击上方按钮关闭 Husk，重新打开后即可游玩 %@。";
