"%@, minimised" = "%@，已最小化";
"• **iOS 27 or later:** Settings › JIT › Pair on this iPhone. No computer needed.\n• **iOS 26:** StikJIT (built in) with a pairing file made on a computer, plus LocalDevVPN.\n• **Older iOS, or Husk inside LiveContainer:** the StikDebug app.\n• **Installed with TrollStore:** TrollStore, with its URL Scheme setting on.\n• **Jailbroken with Dopamine:** turn on JIT for apps in the jailbreak's settings." = "• **iOS 27 或更高版本：**设置 › JIT › 在此 iPhone 上配对，无需电脑。\n• **iOS 26：**使用电脑创建的配对文件、内置 StikJIT 和 LocalDevVPN。\n• **较早的 iOS 或 LiveContainer 内的 Husk：**使用 StikDebug。\n• **通过 TrollStore 安装：**使用 TrollStore，并开启 URL Scheme。\n• **Dopamine 越狱：**在越狱设置中允许应用使用 JIT。";
"• **Opens and closes instantly:** the signing certificate has probably expired. Free Apple accounts last 7 days. Re-sign or reinstall Husk with your sideloader; your apps and saves stay.\n• **“Untrusted Developer”:** go to Settings › General › VPN & Device Management and trust your certificate.\n• **Asks for Developer Mode:** turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security." = "• **打开后立即关闭：**签名证书可能已过期。免费 Apple 账号签名有效期为 7 天。请使用原侧载工具重新签名或覆盖安装，并保持相同签名身份和应用标识以保留数据。\n• **不受信任的开发者：**前往设置 › 通用 › VPN 与设备管理，信任证书。\n• **要求开发者模式：**前往设置 › 隐私与安全性开启。";
"1 pixel per point. Fastest." = "每点 1 像素，速度最快。";
"1. Make sure **LocalDevVPN** is installed and connected. The VPN icon should be in the status bar.\n2. Wi-Fi must be on, even though nothing leaves your iPhone.\n3. **Developer Mode** must be on (Settings › Privacy & Security › Developer Mode).\n4. The first time, Husk downloads Apple's Developer Disk Image, which can take a minute. Let it finish.\n5. Still failing? Toggle LocalDevVPN off and on, then pair again." = "1. 确认已安装并连接 **LocalDevVPN**，状态栏应显示 VPN 图标。\n2. 必须开启 Wi-Fi，即使数据不会离开 iPhone。\n3. 开启**开发者模式**（设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式）。\n4. 首次会下载 Apple 开发者磁盘映像，可能需要一分钟，请等待完成。\n5. 仍然失败？断开并重新连接 LocalDevVPN，然后重新配对。";
"1.5 pixels per point." = "每点 1.5 像素。";
"2 pixels per point. The default." = "每点 2 像素，默认选项。";
"A backup is a .zip of everything %@ has saved in Husk, to keep in Files or move to another device." = "备份是包含 %@ 在 Husk 中所有存档的 .zip 文件，可保存到“文件”或传输至其他设备。";
