"Adds a sound device. Android cannot be saved while this is on, so every launch boots from cold." = "添加声音设备。启用后无法保存 Android 状态，因此每次启动都需冷启动。";
"Adds a sound device. While it is attached Android cannot be saved — QEMU refuses to snapshot a machine with one — so every launch boots from cold. Turning it on or off costs a cold boot either way." = "添加声音设备。连接期间 QEMU 无法保存此虚拟机的快照，因此每次启动都需冷启动。开启或关闭此选项均需冷启动一次。";
"Adds about 2 GB to the first download. It was captured on the software renderer, so it is not used on GPU — which cold-boots once and then saves its own." = "首次下载将增加约 2 GB。此快照使用软件渲染，不适用于 GPU；GPU 模式会先冷启动一次，再保存自己的存档。";
"After playing, once per game per update" = "游玩后询问，每个游戏每次更新仅一次";
"All" = "全部";
"Always" = "始终";
"Always this look." = "始终使用此外观。";
"An APK is added to your library when it finishes. Anything else goes into the Shared Storage folder, which games see as their phone storage." = "APK 下载完成后会加入游戏库。其他文件会保存到共享储存空间，游戏可将其作为手机储存访问。";
"An app will not open" = "应用无法打开";
"Android and Translation Layer games need JIT, which on iOS only an attached debugger can grant. StikJIT is built into Husk and is the recommended way: it turns JIT on from inside the app, with no computer and no other app. StikDebug and TrollStore work too." = "Android 和转译层游戏都需要 JIT。在 iOS 上，需连接调试器以取得权限。推荐使用 Husk 内置的 StikJIT，无需电脑或其他应用即可启用。也可使用 StikDebug 和 TrollStore。";
"Android and Translation Layer games need JIT. StikJIT, built into Husk, turns it on without a computer." = "Android 和转译层游戏都需要 JIT。Husk 内置的 StikJIT 无需电脑即可启用它。";
"Android App Info" = "Android 应用信息";
"Android apps and games are compiled while they run, which needs memory that can be written and then run. iOS only allows that while a debugger is attached to the app. Turning on JIT attaches one for a moment. Without it, Husk can show your library but cannot start Android or a game." = "Android 应用和游戏在运行时编译代码，需要可先写入再执行的内存。iOS 仅在连接调试器时允许这样做，启用 JIT 会短暂连接调试器。未启用时，Husk 可显示游戏库，但无法启动 Android 或游戏。";
"Android apps, on your iPhone." = "在 iPhone 上运行 Android 应用。";
"Android cannot reshape a screen once it is running, so a landscape game on a portrait screen gets letterboxed into a band and looks tiny. Creating it landscape is the only way it can fill it — portrait apps are letterboxed instead. Costs one cold boot." = "Android 启动后无法更改屏幕形状。横屏游戏在竖屏下会缩小并留边；使用横屏启动才能铺满屏幕，竖屏应用则会留边。更改后需冷启动一次。";
"Android draws on the real GPU through Metal — about four times the frame rate. This is the default." = "Android 通过 Metal 使用真实 GPU 渲染，帧率约为软件渲染的四倍。这是默认选项。";
"Android installs it from where it already is — nothing is copied." = "Android 将直接从当前位置安装，无需复制。";
"Android is booting…" = "Android 正在启动…";
"Android is ready" = "Android 已就绪";
"Android needs memory it can write and then run, which on iOS only an attached debugger can grant. Choose how your %@ gets one." = "Android 需要可先写入再执行的内存。在 iOS 上，需连接调试器以取得权限。请选择为你的 %@ 启用权限的方式。";
"Android reaches the internet through a virtual ethernet card on QEMU's own network. Nothing on your phone's network can see the guest, and the guest cannot see it." = "Android 通过 QEMU 网络中的虚拟以太网卡联网。手机网络中的设备无法访问 Android，Android 也无法访问它们。";
"Android runs fully emulated, so it is slower than games on the translation layer. Use it for apps Husk cannot run directly, like Termux or app stores." = "Android 通过完整模拟运行，因此比转译层游戏慢。适用于 Husk 无法直接运行的应用，例如 Termux 或应用商店。";
"Android takes a long time to start" = "Android 启动耗时很长";
"Android update ready" = "Android 更新已就绪";
"Android will boot from cold once, then save a new one." = "Android 将进行一次冷启动，然后保存新的存档。";
"Android's native code expects things of the processor and of memory that only the phone can answer -- above all, whether a library's code can run with its data writable right beside it. Enable JIT first, or the memory checks are skipped. The results go to the console too." = "Android 原生代码依赖设备处理器与内存的特性，尤其是能否在代码旁保留可写数据。请先启用 JIT，否则将跳过内存检查。结果也会写入控制台。";
