"Open its page in the Library. Husk says why it stopped:\n• **Protected app:** it checks that it is on a real Android phone, or uses anti-cheat or DRM. Husk does not get around these.\n• **Wrong kind of CPU code:** the APK only has 32-bit code. Find an arm64 (arm64-v8a) version.\n• **Incomplete app or missing game data:** the APK needs its split files or an OBB. Import the full .apks, .xapk or .apkm.\n• **Needs Google:** the app requires a Google account or Play services Husk cannot provide.\n• **Uses something Husk does not have yet:** share the report so it can be added." = "打开游戏库中的应用页面，Husk 会说明停止原因：\n• **受保护的应用：**检查真实 Android 设备或使用反作弊、DRM。Husk 不会绕过保护。\n• **CPU 架构不兼容：**APK 仅包含 32 位代码，请寻找 arm64（arm64-v8a）版本。\n• **应用不完整或缺少游戏数据：**需要分包或 OBB，请导入完整的 .apks、.xapk 或 .apkm。\n• **需要 Google：**依赖 Husk 无法提供的账号或 Play 服务。\n• **尚不支持的功能：**请分享报告以便完善支持。";
