"The app's video is DRM-protected (Widevine), which only certified Android devices can decrypt. Unprotected video plays; protected video stays black." = "此应用的视频受 Widevine DRM 保护，仅认证 Android 设备可解密。未受保护的视频可播放，受保护的视频会黑屏。";
