"The first full release." = "首个正式版本。";
"The first launch of a big game prepares its code and data, and can take up to a minute. If it is still black after that, close it, open it once more and share the report if nothing changes." = "大型游戏首次启动需准备代码与数据，可能耗时一分钟。之后仍然黑屏时，请关闭并重新打开；若无改善，请分享报告。";
