"The game stopped" = "游戏已停止";
"The library marks each game with how it did last time: it plays, it crashed, or it did not start." = "游戏库会标记各游戏上次的运行结果：可游玩、崩溃或无法启动。";
"The list is written to disk, so it is on screen before Android has finished starting." = "列表会保存到磁盘，因此在 Android 完成启动前即可显示。";
"The pairing file stays in Husk's Documents folder and is only sent to Husk's own helper." = "配对文件保存在 Husk 的 Documents 文件夹中，仅发送给 Husk 自身的辅助扩展。";
"The panel is built when the machine starts, so a change costs one cold boot, and the next save replaces the machine saved at the old size — changing back costs another. Sizes are rounded to a multiple of eight. Bigger is slower: every pixel is drawn by an emulated phone. Android's density does not change with the panel, so a larger one shows more rather than bigger." = "屏幕在虚拟机启动时创建，因此更改后需冷启动一次，下次保存会替换旧尺寸的存档。改回也需冷启动。尺寸会取整为 8 的倍数。分辨率越大越慢；Android 的显示密度不变，因此显示内容更多，而非内容变大。";
"The plan, in order, is docs/04-translation-layer.md in Husk's source." = "开发计划及其顺序见 Husk 源码中的 docs/04-translation-layer.md。";
"The report holds the full log of that run and which device and build it was on. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you share it." = "报告包含本次运行的完整日志、设备及构建版本。只有你主动分享时才会发送。";
