"This APK has no 64-bit code Husk can run, so it will probably not start." = "此 APK 不包含 Husk 可运行的 64 位代码，可能无法启动。";
"This app carries anti-tamper protection (%@). Such protection checks that it runs on a certified Android phone and closes the app otherwise, so it may not start in Husk." = "此应用包含防篡改保护（%@），会检查是否运行在认证的 Android 手机上，否则关闭应用，因此可能无法在 Husk 中启动。";
"This app does its main work in Linux programs it starts as processes of their own (here %@). Its own screens run in Husk, but iOS does not let an app start other processes, so those programs, and the games or tools they run, can not start yet." = "此应用依赖作为独立进程启动的 Linux 程序（此处为 %@）。界面可在 Husk 中运行，但 iOS 不允许应用启动其他进程，因此这些程序及其游戏或工具尚无法启动。";
"This app is published in several pieces (split APKs) and only its base was imported, so its libraries or resources are missing. Import the whole bundle (.apks, .xapk or .apkm), or get it from Husk's store." = "此应用由多个分包 APK 组成，但只导入了基础包，缺少库或资源。请导入完整的 .apks、.xapk 或 .apkm 包，或通过 Husk 商店下载。";
"This app only works signed in to a Google account. It asked Android to pick one, and Husk has no Google accounts to offer, so the app closed." = "此应用必须登录 Google 账号。它请求 Android 选择账号，但 Husk 无法提供 Google 账号，因此应用已关闭。";
"This app relies on Google Play services (Google sign-in, Google's account and device checks) for more than Husk can answer for. Apps that only use Google's libraries run; this one stops without the real services." = "此应用依赖 Google Play 服务的账号登录、账号与设备检查等功能，超出了 Husk 的支持范围。只调用 Google 库的应用可能运行，但此应用需要真实的服务。";
"This device closed the connection, which usually means it no longer accepts Husk's pairing. Pair again, and check that LocalDevVPN is connected." = "设备关闭了连接，通常意味着它不再接受 Husk 的配对。请重新配对，并确认 LocalDevVPN 已连接。";
"This device is jailbroken, so JIT comes from the jailbreak's Allow JIT in Apps setting." = "此设备已越狱，可在越狱设置中允许应用使用 JIT。";
"This file is not an app Husk can read" = "Husk 无法读取此应用文件";
"This game keeps most of its data in an expansion file (OBB) that the Play Store downloads separately from the app. Husk installed the app itself but not that file, so the game cannot load." = "此游戏的大部分数据位于 Play 商店单独下载的 OBB 扩展文件中。Husk 只安装了应用，缺少该文件，因此游戏无法加载。";
"This installation can only wait about 30 seconds in the background, so go to Settings straight away." = "当前安装方式在后台只能等待约 30 秒，请立即前往系统设置。";
"This iPhone" = "此 iPhone";
"This is Geode's Android launcher. On Husk, Geode runs inside Geometry Dash instead: turn it on here (or in Geometry Dash's settings, under Mods), then start Geometry Dash and use Geode's button on its main menu to get mods. This APK supplies a library Geode needs, so keep it." = "这是 Geode 的 Android 启动器。在 Husk 中，Geode 直接在 Geometry Dash 内运行：在此处或游戏设置的“模组”中启用，再启动 Geometry Dash，通过主菜单的 Geode 按钮获取模组。此 APK 提供必需的库，请保留。";
"This was removed." = "此项目已移除。";
