"When a game takes Husk down, the next launch says what happened and gives you a report to share." = "游戏导致 Husk 崩溃后，下次启动会说明原因并提供可分享的报告。";
"When a new Android image or snapshot is published, Husk asks once whether to download it. Never asked before Android has been downloaded." = "发布新的 Android 映像或快照时，Husk 会询问一次是否下载。尚未下载过 Android 时不会询问。";
