"Whenever Android or a game starts, Husk asks TrollStore to enable JIT. TrollStore opens Husk, attaches to it for a moment and lets go, which leaves it allowed to run code it wrote." = "每次启动 Android 或游戏时，Husk 会请求 TrollStore 启用 JIT。TrollStore 打开 Husk，短暂连接调试器后断开，使其可以执行动态生成的代码。";
